OL,3,GNEWSA'The phone is my elderly mum's    
OL,4,Alifeline, but cable thefts have left   
OL,5,Aher isolated'                          
OL,7,F"She has not been able to speak to her 
OL,8,Fsister, but most importantly, if she   
OL,9,Fneeded it, she would not be able to    
OL,10,Fcall the emergency services - and that 
OL,11,Fis scary."                             
